<title>USA: Asset Guaranty qualifies Fort Bend County, Texas.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty qualifies Fort Bend County, Texas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co. said Tuesday it qualified Fort Bend County Municipal Utility District No 30, Texas's $2.33 million bond deal, under the company's optional purchase program.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
